    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like it's just my head. i see the look in my husband's eyes when i'm having a bad day, that exhaustion. and my daughter... she tries so hard to make me smile but she shouldn't have to grow up acting like my caretaker. it's like i'm an anchor. if i wasn't here, they wouldn't have to carry this weight. they could just be free.",
